@not_built
on-arrival: panzerkreuzer_b_funded = 0; budget += 1 if panzerkreuzer_funded = 0; coup_progress += 1

我们反对战列巡洋舰的表决获得成功,得到共产党与 [+ ddp_name +] 中反战人士的支持。这艘军舰将不会被建造! [? if panzerkreuzer_funded == 0 : We have saved some budget from not funding the two ships. ?]

